      "desc_en": "Create and manage production Grafana dashboards for real-time visualization of system and application metrics. Use when building monitoring dashboards, visualizing metrics, or creating operational observability interfaces.",
      "path": ".agents/skills/grafana-dashboards/SKILL.md",
