          "content": "# THIRD PARTY\n\nOrigin of everything taken from other projects. Libraries installed as dependencies live in the lockfile and the dependency register; list here only code or ideas studied, adapted or copied.\n\n| Project | URL | Version / commit | License | What was used | How (dependency / adapted / idea only) | Date |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\nCopyright notices that must be kept: (paste the notice for each adapted part).\n"
