      "desc_en": "Use whenever the current task involves marketing, content, copywriting, branding, social media, SEO, paid ads, email, PR, growth, sales enablement or marketing analytics but the active project has no local marketing skills — i.e. any project other than \"SIP - Marketing\" (0 Mkt) itself. Routes the task to the central marketing knowledge hub instead of improvising from general knowledge. Also use when the user asks \"existe algo de marketing pra isso\", \"tem skill de marketing no hub\", \"consulta o SIP - Marketing\", or names a 0 Mkt skill, agent or workflow explicitly in a project that isn't the hub.",
